  189  p13  paragraph  [p13-l10]  ✓ A4. Have you used AI writing assistants when working on this paper?
  190  p13  paragraph  [p13-l11..p13-l12 (2)]  Yes, we use Grammarly and ChatGPT for assistance purely with the language of the paper (e.g.,\ngrammar error checking and paper paraphrasing). We mainly use them in the introduction.
  191  p13  paragraph  [p13-l13]  B ✓ Did you use or create scientific artifacts?
