  93  p6  heading (A)  [p6-l75]  A Appendix
  94  p6  heading (A.1)  [p6-l76..p6-l77 (2)]  A.1 Sample Instantiations
  95  p6  paragraph  [p6-l78..p6-l83 (6)]  Below are sample instantiations for the Single\nSentence and Two Action structures. The complete\ndatasets for all the structures can be accessed\nat https://github.com/DanHardtDK/\nellipsisGPT3.
  96  p6  paragraph  [p6-l84]  Single Sentence
  97  p6  paragraph  [p6-l85]  Mary went swimming, and Harold did too.
  98  p6  paragraph  [p6-l86..p6-l87 (2)]  Mary went swimming, and Harold went swimming\ntoo.
  99  p6  paragraph  [p6-l88]  Q: Did Harold go swimming?
  100  p6  paragraph  [p6-l89]  A: Yes
  101  p6  paragraph  [p6-l90]  Mary went swimming, but Harold didn’t.
  102  p6  paragraph  [p6-l91..p6-l92 (2)]  Mary went swimming, but Harold didn’t go swim-\nming.
  103  p6  paragraph  [p6-l93]  Q: Did Harold go swimming?
  104  p6  paragraph  [p6-l94]  A: No
  105  p6  paragraph  [p6-l95]  Two Actions
  106  p6  paragraph  [p6-l96]  Mary didn’t go swimming but Harold did.
  107  p6  paragraph  [p6-l97]  Mary went shopping and Harold didn’t.
  108  p6  paragraph  [p6-l98..p6-l99 (2)]  Mary didn’t go swimming but Harold did go swim-\nming.
  109  p6  paragraph  [p6-l100..p6-l101 (2)]  Mary went shopping and Harold didn’t go shop-\nping.
  110  p6  paragraph  [p6-l102]  Q: Did Harold go swimming?
  111  p6  paragraph  [p6-l103]  A: Yes
  112  p6  paragraph  [p6-l104..p6-l105 (2)]  Q: Did Harold go shopping?\nA: No
