  17  p2  paragraph  [p2-l35..p2-d120 (9)]  {p2-d119..p2-d120 (2)@302}  where me is the electron mass and m∗ = ℏ2∆/v2F is\nthe effective mass of massive Dirac electron, vF is the\nFermi velocity and 2∆ is the energy gap and gs, gν are\nspin/valley degeneracy. qF is defined by the Fermi en-\nergy EF = pv2Fq2F + ∆2. The extrinsic contribution is\nFermi surface effect σextOH = 21
