  68  p4  paragraph  [p4-l39..p4-l40 (2)]  Wickham, H. (2014). Tidy data. Journal of Statistical Software, Articles, 59(10), 1–23.\nhttps://doi.org/10.18637/jss.v059.i10
  69  p4  paragraph  [p4-l41..p4-d1 (6)]  {p4-d1@105}  Wickham, H. (2016). ggplot2: Elegant graphics for data analysis. Springer-Verlag.\nISBN: 978-3-319-24277-4
