  1  p1  paragraph  [p1-l1..p1-l3 (3)]  PyMedPhys: A community effort to develop an open,\nPython-based standard library for medical physics\napplications
  2  p1  paragraph  [p1-l4..p1-d8 (12)]  {p1-d1..p1-d8 (8)@68}  Simon Biggs\n1, Matthew Jennings\n2, Stuart Swerdloff 3, Phillip\nChlap
  3  p1  paragraph  [p1-l8..p1-d10 (3)]  {p1-d9..p1-d10 (2)@15}  4,5, Derek Lane
  4  p1  paragraph  [p1-l9..p1-d22 (19)]  {p1-d11..p1-d22 (12)@95}  6, Jacob Rembish\n7, Jacob McAloney\n8, Paul\nKing\n9, Rafael Ayala\n10, Fada Guan\n11, Nicola Lambri
  5  p1  paragraph  [p1-l16]  12,13, Cody
  6  p1  paragraph  [p1-l17]  Crewson14, and Matthew Sobolewski8,15
  7  p1  paragraph  [p1-l18]  1 Radiotherapy AI, Wagga Wagga, Australia 2 The Royal Adelaide Hospital, Adelaide, Australia 3
